  _hitQuips: 
  - The skeleton clubs you with a bone. It's using itself as a weapon.
  - A solid whack. The bone doesn't break. Yours might.
  _missQuips: 
  - The skeleton swings and misses. It rattles in frustration.
  - The bone club whooshes overhead. The skeleton looks embarrassed. Well, more embarrassed.
  _critQuips: 
  - Critical bone club! The skeleton puts its whole body into it. Literally.
